flowchart LR
  C[Customer] --> A[Open Menu / Place Order]
  A --> B[Select Items]
  B --> D[POST /orders]
  D --> E[Server: Validate Items & Pricing]
  E --> F[Persist Order; update inventory/status]
  F --> G[Notify Kitchen & Staff]
  G --> H[Order Prepared]
  H --> I[Order Delivered to Room / Pickup]
  I --> J[Mark Delivered -> Update Billing]
